msgid "Country: "
msgstr "Pays : "

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:11
msgid "City: "
msgstr "Ville : "

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:14
msgid "Latitude: "
msgstr "Latitude : "

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:15
msgid "Longitude: "
msgstr "Longitude : "

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:18
msgid "UTC Time: "
msgstr "Heure UTC : "

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:19
msgid "Local Time: "
msgstr "Heure Locale : "

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:22
msgid "Chart System: "
msgstr "Système de Thème : "

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:22
msgid "Astro-Numerology Egizio"
msgstr "Astro-Numérologie Égyptienne"

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:26
msgid "Magic Square"
msgstr "Carré Magique"

#: .\templates\components\home\chartData.html:49
msgid "Lucky numbers for today"
msgstr "Nombres porte-bonheur du jour"

#: .\templates\components\home\chartDescription.html:2
msgid "Advanced Astro-Numerology System"
msgstr "Système Avancé d'Astro-Numérologie"

#: .\templates\components\home\chartDescription.html:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Astro Magnetismo is a unique, advanced platform and system that "
"integrates Astrology, Numerology, and Magnetism into a single system of "
"knowledge.\n"
"        A unique chart that connects stars, planets, houses, signs, numbers, "
"and real life.\n"
"        This method introduces an innovative key: \n"
"        "
